{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1454675-oblivion-sight-can-you-talk-to-the-ghosts","id":1454675,"title":"Oblivion Sight: Can You Talk to the Ghosts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-11T00:23:13-07:00","id":1454675,"title":"Oblivion Sight: Can You Talk to the Ghosts?","content":"In a game I am playing in my character has oblivion sight and I and the GM were under the impression that it allows the kindred to talk to ghosts, but another player said it specifically doesn't say that. I reread it and to me it implies that one can communicate with ghosts.<br /> <br /> Am I right or is the other player right?<br /> <br /> If a developer happens to see this I would be grateful your your two cents.<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-11T02:20:49-07:00","id":1454678,"title":"","content":"Technically, you<i> can</i>. However, I don't know if the vampire can hear across the shroud using Oblivion's Sight, the write up doesn't specify if more senses pierce the shroud or if it's just sight (touch is specified as a &quot;no&quot;) but the wraiths will likely notice if you address them and wraiths can communicate back, in various fashions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":26836,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","user":"Rhywbeth","date":". 07-11-2021, 05:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-11T08:43:25-07:00","id":1454688,"title":"","content":"You can see them, but you can't hear them - and they cannot hear you. So you would have to use charades to communicate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-11T19:55:36-07:00","id":1454714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1454675-oblivion-sight-can-you-talk-to-the-ghosts?p=1454688#post1454688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can see them, but you can't hear them - and they cannot hear you. So you would have to use charades to communicate.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes and no to this. If you want technicality then Oblivion Sight doesn't allow you to hear across the veil so this part is correct, but wraiths can totally sense across the veil with ease that is not the issue. A wraith can watch a loved one slowly die in front of them, hearing each and every breath they take before they pass, and find it impossible to aid them at all. The only mercy is the likelihood that their loved one will most likely not suffer the same fate as them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><div align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/7.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26764-vilenecromancer","name":"Vilenecromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26764_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"247"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-11T20:53:55-07:00","id":1454717,"title":"","content":"In games I've played in, ghosts can hear anything the Necromancer says. The Necromancer can't normally hear what ghosts say, but she can see across the shroud, so ghosts can engage in charades or pantomimes or write things in the Shadowlands in order to communicate back with the Necromancer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}